# Customer Plan
**Monthly customers, recurring revenue and operating cash**

Churn is rounded to whole accounts and applied to the opening customer base. Price adjustments take effect each January. Operating cash excludes financing, tax and capitalized development, and assumes collections track revenue.

The first-year focus is cash discipline while new acquisition capacity is established; subsequent hiring is paced against recurring gross profit.

