# Annual Plan
**Annual operating targets and funding position**

The year-end ARR is an annualized run rate, not revenue recognized during the year. Revenue and spending sum the twelve monthly periods; ending customers and cash are December balances.

| @meta |  || {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} |
|  | Year || Opening customers | New customers | Churned customers | Ending customers | Revenue | Ending ARR | Gross profit | Acquisition spend | Payroll | Operating cash | Ending cash |
|  | --- || --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
|  | 2026 || = @["Customer Plan"::B2] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::C2:C13]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::D2:D13]) | = @["Customer Plan"::E13] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::G2:G13]) | = @["Customer Plan"::H13] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::I2:I13]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::J2:J13]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::L2:L13]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::N2:N13]) | = @["Customer Plan"::P13] |
|  | 2027 || = @["Customer Plan"::B14] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::C14:C25]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::D14:D25]) | = @["Customer Plan"::E25] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::G14:G25]) | = @["Customer Plan"::H25] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::I14:I25]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::J14:J25]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::L14:L25]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::N14:N25]) | = @["Customer Plan"::P25] |
|  | 2028 || = @["Customer Plan"::B26] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::C26:C37]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::D26:D37]) | = @["Customer Plan"::E37] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::G26:G37]) | = @["Customer Plan"::H37] | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::I26:I37]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::J26:J37]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::L26:L37]) | = sum(@["Customer Plan"::N26:N37]) | = @["Customer Plan"::P37] |

# Unit Economics
**Operating review | growth quality and funding**

LTV uses the opening account price and steady-state churn, with gross margin applied before acquisition cost. It is an operating benchmark, not a discounted customer valuation. Price increases and expansion revenue are not built into that benchmark.

| Metric || Value |
| --- || --- |
| Opening MRR || = @["Drivers"::["Opening customers","Value"]] * @["Drivers"::["Monthly revenue per customer","Value"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Ending MRR || = @["Customer Plan"::["2028-12","MRR"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Ending ARR || = B3 * 12 {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Three-year recurring revenue || = sum(@["Customer Plan"::G2:G37]) {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Monthly compounded MRR growth || = exp(ln(B3 / B2) / 36) - 1 {:.1%} |
| Customer acquisition cost || = @["Drivers"::["Acquisition cost per customer","Value"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Gross-profit lifetime value || = @["Drivers"::["Monthly revenue per customer","Value"]] * @["Drivers"::["Gross margin","Value"]] / @["Drivers"::["Monthly churn rate","Value"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| LTV to CAC || = B8 / B7 {:.2f} |
| CAC payback months || = B7 / (@["Drivers"::["Monthly revenue per customer","Value"]] * @["Drivers"::["Gross margin","Value"]]) {:.1f} |
| Twelve-month account retention || = power(1 - @["Drivers"::["Monthly churn rate","Value"]], 12) {:.1%} |
| Ending customers || = @["Customer Plan"::["2028-12","Closing"]] |
| Total acquired accounts || = sum(@["Customer Plan"::C2:C37]) |
| Total churned accounts || = sum(@["Customer Plan"::D2:D37]) |
| Ending cash || = @["Customer Plan"::["2028-12","Closing cash"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Lowest month-end cash || = min(@["Customer Plan"::P2:P37]) {:,.2f} {::>} |
| First-year operating cash || = @["Annual Plan"::["2026","Operating cash"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Third-year operating cash || = @["Annual Plan"::["2028","Operating cash"]] {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Sales efficiency priority || Maintain channel mix as acquisition scales |
